  "protocols": {
    "throughput": "Fresh processes; setup and validation outside reported workload interval; no perf counters. Reverse two-mode order on even rounds, cyclic rotate three-node order. No outliers removed.",
    "confirmation": "Five 30-second micro pairs and three full XIndex rounds; separate changed-input holdouts use five 30-second pairs. Screen selection rules are retained.",
    "profiles": "Separate diagnostics, excluded from throughput means. XIndex enabled by read-only observation of existing run_control and disabled at existing completed-operation output. Micro uses existing acknowledged perf FIFOs.",
    "live_residency": "Micro prints three live page samples per object. Production arena checks all still-resident selected extent pages at exit; a freed large ballast may be purged by then. Interleaved cases additionally snapshot live mappings and NUMA page counts after the existing g_start flag, checking full initialized object-containing VMAs. XIndex selected allocations remain live at the arena check.",
    "state": "XIndex: 400M completed operations and the existing 4096-key digest. Micro: existing operation mix, write/version and epoch checks. Not a full-key XIndex state proof.",
    "sampling": "PEBS branch/locked-load estimates use period-weighted counts per operation. Instruction samples use event periods. Ordinary cycle sample IPs can skid; stall events overlap.",
    "latency": "Exploratory load-latency records include below-threshold weights and out-of-order warnings; no all-load mean or stall partition is inferred."
  },
